  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400°F (200°C).",
    "Cut the onion, bell pepper, carrots, and potatoes into 1-inch cubes.",
    "Place the vegetables on a baking sheet and roast for 20 minutes.",
    "In a large pan, heat the avocado oil over medium heat.",
    "Add the fregola and cook for 2-3 minutes, stirring frequently.",
    "Add the roasted vegetables, tomato paste, oregano, basil, garlic powder, salt, and pepper to the pan.",
    "Stir to combine and cook for an additional 2-3 minutes.",
    "Use a spatula to break up any clumps and cook for another minute.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy!"
